N[elson] drove the length of the floor and hit a pull-up 14-footer at the end of the first OT to tie the game. He made four free throws in the final :05 of the second OT to help erase deficits of three and two points and force a third extra session. He[ sank] two 3-pointers and scored 12 points in the third overtime.
